Add .github/workflows/build-binary.yml: single ubuntu-latest matrix job that
cross-compiles `bun build --compile --target=<t>` for the 5 canonical targets
(windows-x64, darwin-arm64, darwin-x64, linux-x64, linux-arm64) plus musl
variants (linux-x64-musl, linux-arm64-musl). Bun cross-compiles all from one
runner. Regenerates the embed manifest inside the job. Smoke-tests the native
linux-x64 binary (--version + setup --quick + ready); other targets are
artifact-only with a non-empty assertion. Runs parity-check.mjs as the drift
gate. Uploads each binary as a named artifact. Triggers: workflow_dispatch,
release tags (v*), and a 1-target compile+smoke on relevant PRs.

Authored via the 'workflows' protected-state surface (hook ON + audited).
Release upload deferred to Step 4 (50afbc47).

Issue: f13b5073-3b9f-4098-bbe4-432b7bd69485
Epic: 6f11d483-5cf0-4fce-86a4-42c82dff0897

